{'symbol': 'PG', 'date': '2019-10-07 22:30:00', 'title': 'THE PROCTER & GAMBLE COMPANY DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND AND PREFERRED STOCKS', 'text': 'THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF THE PROCTER & GAMBLE COMPANY DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.7459 PER SHARE ON THE COMMON STOCK AND ON THE SERIES A AND SERIES B ESOP CONVERTIBLE CLASS A PREFERRED STOCK OF THE COMPANY, PAYABLE ON OR AFTER NOVEMBER 15, 2019 TO COMMON STOCK SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON OCTOBER 18, 2019, AND TO SERIES A AND SERIES B ESOP CONVERTIBLE CLASS A PREFERRED STOCK SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE START OF BUSINESS ON OCTOBER 18, 2019.'}